-- חוזר לבעלויות תשס"ט/10: קצובת ביגוד לשנת הלימודים תשס"ט
-- The clothing allowance for school year 2008/09 (תשס"ט): who is entitled,
-- the amount by teaching seniority, the extra allowance for physical-education
-- teachers and for technological-education staff, pro-rating by position, and
-- the month it is paid in.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשס"ט/10 קצובת ביגוד לשנת הלימודים תשס"ט`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, the circular's title, its subject line and the opening words "according to the Treasury's instructions on the clothing allowance, act as follows"; the rules are sections א–ג.

@desc A teaching employee's school year 2008/09, as far as this circular asks about it.
DECLARE `clothing year` HAS
    `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS A BOOLEAN @desc the employee is graded in the teaching-staff grade (דירוג עובדי הוראה)
    `years of teaching seniority`        IS A NUMBER  @desc seniority in teaching (ותק בהוראה), in years
    `position fraction`                  IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position held (1 = one full position)
    `teaches physical education`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `physical-education employment rate` IS A NUMBER  @desc the employment rate (שיעור העסקה) section ב's table is read by; see F-2008-09_tashsat_10-c
    `in technological education`         IS A BOOLEAN @desc a teaching employee in technological education or a professional instructor (מדריך מקצועי)
    `technological professions taught`   IS A LIST OF STRING @desc the professions taught, as section ג's lists print them

@desc The things section ג grants in kind.
DECLARE `clothing item` IS ONE OF
    `a pair of shoes`
    `a robe`

DECLARE `clothing action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the clothing allowance` HAS `amount of clothing allowance paid` IS A NUMBER

§§ `א קצובת ביגוד – כללי`

-- "יש לשלמה במלואה": the allowance is paid whole, in one payment, with the
-- July 2009 salary; "במלואה" is read as one payment, not as setting aside
-- section א.5's pro-rating, which the same section states in the same breath.
-- Time is counted in school months of 2008/09 (common.l4: September = 1).
-- F-2008-09_tashsat_10-f: only section א, headed "כללי", names the month of
-- payment; sections ב and ג name none. The reading adopted, as
-- F-2010-11_tashaa_03-e and its siblings read the same words: July applies
-- to the whole allowance.
@ref akn:art_a__para_1
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `clothing action`
DECIDE `payment with July's salary` y IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the clothing allowance` `amount paid`
          PROVIDED `amount paid` AT LEAST `clothing allowance` y
    WITHIN `month number` July
    LEST BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "section א.1: the clothing allowance is paid in full with the July 2009 salary"

-- "כנהוג כלפי מקבלי קהל בשירות המדינה": the measure is the civil service's
-- for staff who receive the public; this circular prints the amounts itself.
@ref akn:art_a__para_2
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the clothing allowance` y IF
    y's `in the teaching-staff grade`

`the school year this circular prices` MEANS "תשס\"ט (September 2008 to August 2009)"

-- Section א.3: the payment is by the employee's seniority. The reading
-- adopted (F-2008-09_tashsat_10-a) counts the year being served, so a
-- first-year employee is in year 1 of section א.4's table.
@ref akn:art_a__para_3
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `full-position amount by seniority` y IS
    IF y's `years of teaching seniority` AT LEAST 26
    THEN 1903
    ELSE 1365

-- Section א.4's table, in the printed order: shekels by years of teaching
-- seniority.
@ref akn:art_a__para_4
`the seniority table` MEANS
    LIST `seniority band` 1  25  1365,
         `seniority band` 26 999 1903

DECLARE `seniority band` HAS
    `from seniority year` IS A NUMBER
    `to seniority year`   IS A NUMBER  @desc 999 stands for "ומעלה", with no upper bound
    `band amount`         IS A NUMBER  @desc shekels for a full position

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the amounts the seniority table gives for` n IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `band amount`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD n AT LEAST b's `from seniority year` AND n AT MOST b's `to seniority year`)
                `the seniority table`)

-- Section א.5: the allowance is paid in proportion to the employee's
-- position, and for no more than one full position (100%).
@ref akn:art_a__para_5
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `general clothing allowance` y IS
    IF `entitled to the clothing allowance` y
    THEN `full-position amount by seniority` y TIMES `position share` y
    ELSE 0

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `position share` y IS
    min (y's `position fraction`) 1

§§ `ב קצובת ביגוד נוספת למורה לחינוך גופני`

-- Section ב's table ("סכום נכון ל-1/8/09"), the amount by employment rate:
-- "עד 0.3" 0, "מ-0.3 עד 0.5" 235, "מ-0.5 ומעלה" 467. Its bounds meet at
-- 0.3 and at 0.5 (F-2008-09_tashsat_10-b), and "employment rate" is not
-- said to be of what (F-2008-09_tashsat_10-c).
@ref akn:art_b
`the physical-education table` MEANS
    LIST `employment band` 0   0.3 0,
         `employment band` 0.3 0.5 235,
         `employment band` 0.5 999 467

DECLARE `employment band` HAS
    `from employment rate` IS A NUMBER
    `to employment rate`   IS A NUMBER  @desc 999 stands for "ומעלה"
    `employment band amount` IS A NUMBER

GIVEN r IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the amounts the physical-education table gives for` r IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `employment band amount`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD r AT LEAST b's `from employment rate` AND r AT MOST b's `to employment rate`)
                `the physical-education table`)

-- The reading adopted (F-2008-09_tashsat_10-b): the band that OPENS at a
-- bound ("מ-") governs it, so 0.3 takes 235 and 0.5 takes 467.
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `physical-education allowance` y IS
    IF y's `teaches physical education`
    THEN BRANCH IF y's `physical-education employment rate` AT LEAST 0.5 THEN 467
                IF y's `physical-education employment rate` AT LEAST 0.3 THEN 235
                OTHERWISE 0
    ELSE 0

§§ `ג קצובת ביגוד בחינוך הטכנולוגי`

GIVEN professions IS A LIST OF STRING
      y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `teaches a profession on` professions y IF
        y's `in technological education`
    AND any (GIVEN p YIELD elem p professions) (y's `technological professions taught`)

-- Section ג: a teaching employee in technological education or a
-- professional instructor is paid a clothing allowance for 2008/09 by the
-- list of professions below. ג.1א: one teaching one of these thirteen
-- professions is entitled every year to a pair of shoes and two robes.
@ref akn:art_c/p1 akn:art_c__para_1__subpara_a
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A LIST OF `clothing item`
DECIDE `the items section ג.1א grants to` y IS
    IF `teaches a profession on` `the professions granted shoes and two robes` y
    THEN `the items section ג.1א grants`
    ELSE EMPTY

`the items section ג.1א grants` MEANS LIST `a pair of shoes`, `a robe`, `a robe`

`the professions granted shoes and two robes` MEANS
    LIST "מערכות תעופה",
         "מכטרוניקה",
         "טרמודינמיקה טכנית ימית",
         "מערכות סיב\"מ ותיב\"מ",
         "תחזוקת מערכות מכניות",
         "מערכות מכונאות רכב",
         "מערכות ממוחשבות ברכב",
         "מערכות בקרת אקלים",
         "מערכות הספק, פיקוד ובקרה",
         "אומנות הבישול והאפיה המלונאית",
         "ימאות – ספינות",
         "מערכות טלוויזיה וקולנוע",
         "מערכות צילום"

-- The value line under ג.1א as printed: "ערך שני חלוקים: 308 ₪".
`the items the value line under ג.1א prices` MEANS LIST `a robe`, `a robe`
`the value printed under ג.1א` MEANS 308

-- Section ג.1ב: one teaching one of these twelve professions is entitled
-- to two robes a year.
@ref akn:art_c__para_1__subpara_b
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A LIST OF `clothing item`
DECIDE `the items section ג.1ב grants to` y IS
    IF `teaches a profession on` `the professions granted two robes` y
    THEN `the items section ג.1ב grants`
    ELSE EMPTY

`the items section ג.1ב grants` MEANS LIST `a robe`, `a robe`

`the professions granted two robes` MEANS
    LIST "מערכות אלקטרוניות",
         "מערכות מחשוב ובקרה",
         "מערכות מחשבים",
         "תכנון ותכנות מערכות",
         "מערכות ביוטכנולוגיה",
         "ניהול תיירותי",
         "ניהול מלונאי",
         "חינוך לגיל הרך",
         "עיצוב",
         "אופנה ותלבושות",
         "עיצוב שיער, קוסמטיקה ואיפור",
         "סיעוד"

-- The value line under ג.1ב as printed: "ערך זוג נעליים ושני חלוקים: 498
-- ₪". Each value line prices the OTHER subparagraph's grant
-- (F-2008-09_tashsat_10-d). The reading adopted: the line's own label names
-- what it prices, so shoes and two robes are worth 498 and two robes 308.
`the items the value line under ג.1ב prices` MEANS LIST `a pair of shoes`, `a robe`, `a robe`
`the value printed under ג.1ב` MEANS 498

`the value of shoes and two robes` MEANS `the value printed under ג.1ב`
`the value of two robes` MEANS `the value printed under ג.1א`

-- Section ג.2: this allowance is in addition to the clothing allowance of
-- every teaching employee (section א). Section ב's is likewise an addition.
@ref akn:art_c__para_2
@export default The clothing allowance a teaching employee is owed for school year 2008/09 under circular תשס"ט/10, the general allowance plus the physical-education and technological-education additions
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year` @desc the employee's school year 2008/09
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `clothing allowance` y IS
    `general clothing allowance` y
    PLUS `physical-education allowance` y
    PLUS `technological clothing allowance` y

-- Section ג.3: the technological allowance is paid in proportion to the
-- position, for no more than one full position. Each subparagraph grants on
-- its own words, and an employee teaching on both lists meets both
-- (F-2008-09_tashsat_10-e). The reading adopted, as for the same words in
-- תשס"ז/7 and תשס"ח/6: the larger grant, which holds the two robes the
-- other grants.
@ref akn:art_c__para_3
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `technological clothing allowance` y IS
    `the larger technological grant` y TIMES `position share` y

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the larger technological grant` y IS
    BRANCH IF `teaches a profession on` `the professions granted shoes and two robes` y THEN `the value of shoes and two robes`
           IF `teaches a profession on` `the professions granted two robes` y THEN `the value of two robes`
           OTHERWISE 0

-- The other reading: both grants, added.
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `both grants added` y IS
    (IF `teaches a profession on` `the professions granted shoes and two robes` y THEN `the value of shoes and two robes` ELSE 0)
    PLUS (IF `teaches a profession on` `the professions granted two robes` y THEN `the value of two robes` ELSE 0)

-- akn:art_d The contact line for questions (the conditions-of-service unit's telephone numbers); no rule.

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and signature; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- F-2008-09_tashsat_10-a: the table opens at year 1.
`a first-year employee has no row if seniority counts completed years` MEANS
    `the amounts the seniority table gives for` 0 EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `a first-year employee has no row if seniority counts completed years`

#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD count (`the amounts the seniority table gives for` n) EQUALS 1)
            (LIST 1, 2, 10, 25, 26, 30, 40)

-- F-2008-09_tashsat_10-b: the bounds meet.
`the physical-education table gives 0.3 and 0.5 two amounts each` MEANS
        `the amounts the physical-education table gives for` 0.3 EQUALS LIST 0, 235
    AND `the amounts the physical-education table gives for` 0.5 EQUALS LIST 235, 467
#ASSERT `the physical-education table gives 0.3 and 0.5 two amounts each`

#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD count (`the amounts the physical-education table gives for` r) EQUALS 1)
            (LIST 0, 0.1, 0.29, 0.31, 0.49, 0.51, 1)

-- F-2008-09_tashsat_10-c: "שיעור העסקה" is not said to be the share of the
-- position in physical education or the employee's whole position.
`a full-position teacher with a fifth in physical education` MEANS
    `clothing year` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `years of teaching seniority`        IS 10
        `position fraction`                  IS 1
        `teaches physical education`         IS TRUE
        `physical-education employment rate` IS 0.2
        `in technological education`         IS FALSE
        `technological professions taught`   IS EMPTY

`the two readings of the employment rate differ` MEANS
    NOT (`the amounts the physical-education table gives for` 0.2
         EQUALS `the amounts the physical-education table gives for` 1)
#ASSERT `the two readings of the employment rate differ`

-- F-2008-09_tashsat_10-d: each value line prices the other subparagraph's
-- grant.
`each value line prices the other subparagraph's grant` MEANS
        (NOT (`the items the value line under ג.1א prices` EQUALS `the items section ג.1א grants`))
    AND `the items the value line under ג.1א prices` EQUALS `the items section ג.1ב grants`
    AND `the items the value line under ג.1ב prices` EQUALS `the items section ג.1א grants`
#ASSERT `each value line prices the other subparagraph's grant`

-- On the circular's own amounts.
`a half-position teacher in year 30` MEANS
    `clothing year` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `years of teaching seniority`        IS 30
        `position fraction`                  IS 0.5
        `teaches physical education`         IS FALSE
        `physical-education employment rate` IS 0
        `in technological education`         IS FALSE
        `technological professions taught`   IS EMPTY

#ASSERT `clothing allowance` `a half-position teacher in year 30` EQUALS 951.5

`a full-position mechatronics teacher in year 5` MEANS
    `clothing year` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `years of teaching seniority`        IS 5
        `position fraction`                  IS 1
        `teaches physical education`         IS FALSE
        `physical-education employment rate` IS 0
        `in technological education`         IS TRUE
        `technological professions taught`   IS LIST "מכטרוניקה"

#ASSERT `clothing allowance` `a full-position mechatronics teacher in year 5` EQUALS 1863

#ASSERT `clothing allowance` `a full-position teacher with a fifth in physical education` EQUALS 1365

#TRACE `payment with July's salary` `a half-position teacher in year 30` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the clothing allowance` 951.5 AT 11
#TRACE `payment with July's salary` `a half-position teacher in year 30` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the clothing allowance` 951.5 AT 12

-- F-2008-09_tashsat_10-g: the table bands "שיעור העסקה" without saying whether a teacher
-- with more than one employer is banded per employer or across them; per
-- employer, two at 40% each pay more than one at 80%. The reading adopted,
-- as F-2021-22_tashpab_07-b's: each employer applies the table to the
-- position it employs.
`two employers at 40% each pay more than one employer at 80%` MEANS
    sum (`the amounts the physical-education table gives for` 0.4) PLUS sum (`the amounts the physical-education table gives for` 0.4)
        GREATER THAN sum (`the amounts the physical-education table gives for` 0.8)
#ASSERT `two employers at 40% each pay more than one employer at 80%`

§§ `Property checks`

-- The circular over its whole finite space: years served 0 to 61,
-- positions and employment rates in tenths from 0 to 1.5, every
-- profession of either list, none, and one of each, in technological
-- education or not, in the teaching-staff grade or not.

`tenths to 1.5` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 10) (range 0 15)
`both booleans` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE
`every profession list checked` MEANS
    EMPTY FOLLOWED BY (LIST "מכטרוניקה", "מערכות אלקטרוניות")
          FOLLOWED BY map (GIVEN t YIELD LIST t) (append `the professions granted shoes and two robes` `the professions granted two robes`)

GIVEN g IS A BOOLEAN, n IS A NUMBER, f IS A NUMBER, e IS A NUMBER, k IS A BOOLEAN, l IS A LIST OF STRING
GIVETH A `clothing year`
DECIDE `a checked year` g n f e k l IS
    `clothing year` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS g
        `years of teaching seniority`        IS n
        `position fraction`                  IS f
        `teaches physical education`         IS TRUE
        `physical-education employment rate` IS e
        `in technological education`         IS k
        `technological professions taught`   IS l

-- Section א.4 on the reading adopted (F-2008-09_tashsat_10-a): every year
-- served from 1 to 61 is in exactly one row, the amount is that row's,
-- and it never falls with seniority.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                    count (`the amounts the seniority table gives for` n) EQUALS 1
                AND `the amounts the seniority table gives for` n EQUALS LIST (`full-position amount by seniority` (`a checked year` TRUE n 1 0 FALSE EMPTY))
                AND `full-position amount by seniority` (`a checked year` TRUE n 1 0 FALSE EMPTY)
                    AT MOST `full-position amount by seniority` (`a checked year` TRUE (n PLUS 1) 1 0 FALSE EMPTY))
            (range 1 60)

-- Section ב over employment rates in tenths: every one is in some row, two
-- rows exactly at 0.3 and 0.5 (F-2008-09_tashsat_10-b over the whole
-- space), the amount is one of those rows', and it never falls.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN e YIELD
                LET rows MEANS `the amounts the physical-education table gives for` e
                    a MEANS `physical-education allowance` (`a checked year` TRUE 10 1 e FALSE EMPTY)
                IN      count rows AT LEAST 1
                    AND (count rows EQUALS 2) EQUALS (e EQUALS 0.3 OR e EQUALS 0.5)
                    AND elem a rows
                    AND a AT MOST `physical-education allowance` (`a checked year` TRUE 10 1 (e PLUS 0.1) FALSE EMPTY))
            `tenths to 1.5`

-- Section ג: no profession is on both lists; only one in technological
-- education is granted anything.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN t YIELD NOT elem t `the professions granted two robes`) `the professions granted shoes and two robes`

-- Sections א-ג over every grade, band edge, position and profession list:
-- the whole is never negative, something for anyone in the grade with a
-- position, nothing technological outside technological education, never
-- more than the three top amounts, never falling with a larger position,
-- above one paying as one.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD
                all (GIVEN n YIELD
                        all (GIVEN f YIELD
                                all (GIVEN k YIELD
                                        all (GIVEN l YIELD
                                                LET a MEANS `clothing allowance` (`a checked year` g n f 0.6 k l)
                                                IN      a AT LEAST 0
                                                    AND ((NOT g) OR f EQUALS 0 OR `general clothing allowance` (`a checked year` g n f 0.6 k l) GREATER THAN 0)
                                                    AND (k OR `technological clothing allowance` (`a checked year` g n f 0.6 k l) EQUALS 0)
                                                    AND a AT MOST 1903 PLUS 467 PLUS `the value of shoes and two robes`
                                                    AND a AT MOST `clothing allowance` (`a checked year` g n (f PLUS 0.1) 0.6 k l)
                                                    AND ((f LESS THAN 1) OR a EQUALS `clothing allowance` (`a checked year` g n (f PLUS 0.5) 0.6 k l)))
                                            `every profession list checked`)
                                    `both booleans`)
                            `tenths to 1.5`)
                    (LIST 1, 25, 26, 60))
            `both booleans`

-- F-2008-09_tashsat_10-e: a teacher of מכטרוניקה and of מערכות
-- אלקטרוניות meets both subparagraphs; added, the grants give 498 + 308,
-- the larger alone 498. Over every list checked, the readings part
-- exactly for a teacher on both lists.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN l YIELD
                LET y MEANS `a checked year` TRUE 10 1 0 TRUE l
                IN  (NOT (`both grants added` y EQUALS `the larger technological grant` y))
                    EQUALS (    `teaches a profession on` `the professions granted shoes and two robes` y
                            AND `teaches a profession on` `the professions granted two robes` y))
            `every profession list checked`

`a teacher on both technological lists meets two grants` MEANS
    LET y MEANS `a checked year` TRUE 10 1 0 TRUE (LIST "מכטרוניקה", "מערכות אלקטרוניות")
    IN      `teaches a profession on` `the professions granted shoes and two robes` y
        AND `teaches a profession on` `the professions granted two robes` y
        AND NOT (`both grants added` y EQUALS `the larger technological grant` y)
#ASSERT `a teacher on both technological lists meets two grants`

-- F-2008-09_tashsat_10-f: of the allowance's parts, only the general one names the
-- month it is paid in.
`the months sections ב and ג name for payment` MEANS EMPTY
`sections ב and ג name no month of payment` MEANS
    `the months sections ב and ג name for payment` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `sections ב and ג name no month of payment`
